- `12afad17` — `scripts/monitoring/deploy-rules.sh`: the write side of
  `check-rules-deployed.sh`. Derives the rule-file list from
  prometheus.yml, promtool-checks the repo copy before and the deployed
  copy after, reloads prometheus only once everything validates;
  `--no-reload` for staged deploys. Fleet deploys become copy → check →
  reload in one step instead of three.
